     THE USE OF FACTORIAL DESIGN FOR ANALYSIS OF MERCURY REMOVAL
     EFFICIENCY USING PALM OIL FUEL ASH
     Imla Syafiqah,Hafizuddin Wan Yussof*

 Faculty of Chemical Engineering & Natural Resources, Universiti Malaysia Pahang, 26300 Gambang, Pahang, Malaysia.
 *Corresponding Author Email: hafizuddin@ump.edu.my
